
Property set operations.
USAGE:

SET <assign list>
NOTE: <assign list> can be more than one property name separated by commas.
Each property name should be followed by '=' and its value.

The following writeable properties are available:
Property				Type			Operation
========				====			=========
Attributes                         	uint32              	Read/Write
Comment                            	string              	Read/Write
DefaultPriority                    	uint32              	Read/Write
Direct                             	boolean             	Read/Write
DoCompleteFirst                    	boolean             	Read/Write
DriverName                         	string              	Read/Write
EnableBIDI                         	boolean             	Read/Write
EnableDevQueryPrint                	boolean             	Read/Write
ErrorInformation                   	string              	Read/Write
Hidden                             	boolean             	Read/Write
KeepPrintedJobs                    	boolean             	Read/Write
Local                              	boolean             	Read/Write
Location                           	string              	Read/Write
Network                            	boolean             	Read/Write
Parameters                         	string              	Read/Write
PortName                           	string              	Read/Write
PrintJobDataType                   	string              	Read/Write
PrintProcessor                     	string              	Read/Write
Priority                           	uint32              	Read/Write
Published                          	boolean             	Read/Write
Queued                             	boolean             	Read/Write
RawOnly                            	boolean             	Read/Write
SeparatorFile                      	string              	Read/Write
ShareName                          	string              	Read/Write
Shared                             	boolean             	Read/Write
StartTime                          	datetime            	Read/Write
UntilTime                          	datetime            	Read/Write
WorkOffline                        	boolean             	Read/Write

